<p>Dear $USER.firstName $USER.lastName,</a><br />

<p>Please be advised that $REPORTER.firstName $REPORTER.lastName has resubmitted an Expense Claim for your attention 
on $RESUBMIT_DATE.
This report was originally declined by you on $DECLINE_DATE. The resubmitted Expense Claim details are as follows:</p>

<p>Report Title: $REPORT_TITLE<br />
Report Date: $REPORT_START_DATE <br />
Amount: $REPORT_AMOUNT</p>

<p>The PDF version of the Expense Claim is attached for your attention.</p>

<p>Click <a href="$HOST/Accounting.html?link=$LINK&uid=$uid&cid=$companyid" title="Edit Expense Claim" target="_blank">here </a>
to view the Expense Claim where you can approve or decline it.</p>

<p>Once you approve or decline the report $REPORTER.firstName $REPORTER.lastName will receive email notification about its status.</p>

<p><font color='red'>* </font>If you are not able to click on the link, you can copy and paste the following address into your web browser:<br />
$HOST/Accounting.html?link=$LINK&uid=$uid&cid=$companyid</p>

<p></p>

</body></html>